 that long for\r\nresults, and many actually take longer.\r\n\r\nWe get that it's a long time to wait, but we hope you'll stick with us\r\nbecause we know you'll love the results.\r\n\r\nBesides patience, here are some other things that will help you get the\r\nbest results. Keep in mind that you don't have to do ALL of them, but\r\nwhatever you can do will help:\r\n\r\n- Applying the serum at least once daily, preferably to a clean scalp\r\n- Apply to the scalp, not to the strands\r\n- Massage the serum into the scalp for about a minute to increase\r\ncirculation and assist in the penetration\r\n- Apply in the evenings, if you can\r\n\r\nWe know that hair can be a lot, so if you have other questions, we're happy\r\nto help. Just let us know what we can to do make your journey easier!","dateCreated":"2021-12-27T00:00:00.000Z","avatarUrl":"https://dov7r31oq5dkj.cloudfront.net/9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01/751094d8-9a11-4c3b-b5ec-b5a084ae188b","title":"VEGAMOUR"},"reviewer":{"displayName":"Kathleen W.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"I’ve been using for over","unhelpfulCount":1},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"e20e5fb5-5b96-4eee-9515-64002356f805","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"This works well, just takes some time. I use it twice daily and my bald lash spots have filled in beautifully! So happy this is all natural. I’ve had irritation from previous lash serums but not this one. Perhaps slight redness but nothing I can’t get past!!","dateCreated":"2021-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Katie E.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Love this serum","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"0aee8ba6-6962-4da2-b443-6ecfe493f5bf","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"I’ve been using vegamour’s hair growth serum for 2 years and I wanted to try the lash serum. I have been using it for a few weeks now and I can already tell a difference. I used to get my eyelashes permed and they were so dead and broken, this has absolutely saved my lashes!!!!","dateCreated":"2021-12-18T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-12-18T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Maddy T.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"WOW!","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"95529443-52a9-4a1d-9201-c6f27ab74ca2","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"This serum is very effective. I saw results in 3 weeks. My lashes are growing longer and fuller","dateCreated":"2021-12-17T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-12-17T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Jamie L.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Works great!","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"c4e30227-92b9-4522-bda7-c5ac7393f2e3","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"I have been using this for about 8 months now. I had lash fallout from a surgery I had a couple years back and they never came all the way back in. This worked for me! It took me about 2 months of consistent use but it really increased the length of my lashes and density. It didn’t make them any thicker though, but now my mascara is much more helpful and looks more even- no lash gaps! I now use it once a day for maintenance. Love that it’s vegan and unless you get a ton in your eye it doesn’t cause any irritation for me (none of the vegamour products do which is huge because i’m very sensitive to fragrance and things. no issues here.) I will continue to use because i feel my lashes are much more healthy!","dateCreated":"2021-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":4,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Marlie C.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"healthier longer lashes!","unhelpfulCount":0}]}